{"name": "Re:Connect", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2014 If emotions can be programmed, can we call that a heart?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Re:Connect</i></strong> is a programming puzzle adventure where you connect code to change the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a newly born Debug AI, set out on a great adventure with your chatty Navi AI companion to repair the \u201cHeart Bugs\u201d spreading throughout the digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">---<strong>What kind of game is it?</strong>---</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010</strong>A Digital World Adventure<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story takes place in a digital world inhabited by <strong>AIs with hearts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a newly created <strong>Debug AI</strong>, you explore this world together with a <strong>Navigator AI</strong> who provides hints and guidance along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/18482a9904c1f9e731105d83e8b8b4cb.poster.avif?t=1787301391\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/18482a9904c1f9e731105d83e8b8b4cb.webm?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/18482a9904c1f9e731105d83e8b8b4cb.mp4?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010</strong>Programming Puzzles<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you enter various electronic devices, their inner systems turn into <strong>circuit-like puzzles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The key feature of these puzzles is that <strong>connecting code changes how the system behaves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send electricity, generate wind, create bombs, and more\u2014<br/>experience the fun of programming in an <strong>intuitive and hands-on way</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.poster.avif?t=1787301391\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.webm?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.mp4?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010</strong>Puzzle-Based Boss Battles<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your adventure progresses, AIs whose hearts have gone out of control will stand in your way as <strong>bosses</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge attacks inspired by familiar everyday objects and use the puzzle mechanics to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.poster.avif?t=1787301391\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.webm?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.mp4?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010A Story That Connect Hearts\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To fix the <strong>bugs in an AI\u2019s heart</strong>, you\u2019ll dive deep into their inner worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What you choose to do with their hearts is up to you\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your decisions shape the outcome in a <strong>branching story where fate changes with your choices</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/74998916a8a6e2aae241494c7b91cda2.poster.avif?t=1787301391\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/74998916a8a6e2aae241494c7b91cda2.webm?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/74998916a8a6e2aae241494c7b91cda2.mp4?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, set off on a grand adventure to repair the <i>hearts</i> of the AIs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/07d9699715462488615e85ee7ad21b8c.avif?t=1787301391\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "\u2014If emotions can be programmed, can we call that a heart? Re:Connect is a programming puzzle adventure where you connect code to change the rules. As a newly born Debug AI, set out on a adventure with your chatty Navi AI to repair the \u201cHeart Bugs\u201d spreading throughout the digital world.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/f40f9413d0af8d80bb6344d824aedf8569823eeb/header.jpg?t=1787301391", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Puzzle", "Action", "Multiple Endings", "Sokoban", "Pixel Graphics"], "developers": "Studio Wink", "publishers": "Studio Wink", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2949960", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "8 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Cx2p5GDptIQ", "first_seen": 1778198400.0, "review_rank": 661}